{"id":870,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p>7月19日，中北大学航空宇航学院\"航心映红岚\"暑期社会实践队走进岢岚县毛主席路居馆，开展红色研学活动，为本次暑期社会实践画上句号。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=uM8-UaL7LYMm-bMnmrVnl7bMNl4Mz9SsLl-bo7L8ozLsLm90gihFp2hmCIa0LYyiMSy8M1yPUz9PMm6Rol-Zo7CPM7LaM7MRnR-iUzGaMNrFM4f2nz98MmVFMmr7o7-JqjfTQ4Oeo4xwqsAbgDTJQty0LzGPLSyPLz9aMYbw62z8c&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=11807&e=.jpeg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/355461A8167C9B88F14C04CCD25A006E/70FE8461/65D8B\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=uM8-UaL7LYMm-bMnmrVnl7bMNl4Mz9SsLl-bo7L8ozLsLm90gihFp2hmCIa0LYyiMSy8M1yPUz9PMm6Rol-Zo7CPM7LaM7MRnR-iUzGaMNrFM4f2nz98MmVFMmr7o7-JqjfTQ4Oeo4xwqsAbgDTJQty0LzGPLSyPLz9aMYbw62z8c&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=11807&e=.jpeg\"></p><p>路居馆为青砖灰瓦的朴素院落，1948年毛泽东同志东渡黄河途经岢岚时曾在此留宿，并留下\"岢岚是个好地方\"的赞誉。实践队在讲解员引导下参观展厅，通过历史照片、文献资料及场景复原，系统了解该段红色史实及其在岢岚地方史中的重要意义。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=uMRAUkMmGPn7WVMnzNZM4CaU4rRMmUSsozLZMRUYUmrfL4v0gihFp2hmCIa0okyiMYyPoSyiL8LYnRf2L4N8U4WRMRLbMmV7oR98MzLDMmTFU498nz9bM4fFMRl8LN7JqjfTQ4Oeo4xwqsAbgDTJQty0LzGPLSyPLz9aMYbw62z8c&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=11807&e=.jpeg\" draggable=\"false\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/8571953C2D0F394C2C43961D88453669/C84E8970/4542A\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 352px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=uMRAUkMmGPn7WVMnzNZM4CaU4rRMmUSsozLZMRUYUmrfL4v0gihFp2hmCIa0okyiMYyPoSyiL8LYnRf2L4N8U4WRMRLbMmV7oR98MzLDMmTFU498nz9bM4fFMRl8LN7JqjfTQ4Oeo4xwqsAbgDTJQty0LzGPLSyPLz9aMYbw62z8c&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=11807&e=.jpeg\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=unR9UiU4NiU47bon7-Zo7UPUmGiollSDnmnVLNWfLzV2U8-0gihFp2hmCIa0okh2oSybMkyZLzUiU4r2Lml8ozrRoz6fLNUPUlnfUzT7MlMFM4fVoR-boRMFM4M7oRlJv2bjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PoRGsgtA8pUzcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=11807&e=.png\" draggable=\"false\" vurl=\"/_vsl/8F9948145C5F25495C97A2D1ADAA9D5C/70E82983/73D85\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 340px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=un7UUYnm9ZLlV7Mn7lbM8VkLl-inNrS7UzTRL8lYo7r7Ml70gihFp2hmCIa0okhkLkhknShkUzrVUNLbM4vsnlVRU4WkLRN4LllYMmUsLNrFMRr2LmARnmTFLzT2nm62gjfJQ4Oeo4xwqsAbgDTJQty0LzGPLSyPLz9aMYbw62z8c&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=11807&e=.png\"></p><p>参观过程中，实践队员通过历史照片、文献资料及场景复原，系统了解了1948年毛泽东同志途经岢岚的历史背景与细节。结合此前支教期间向社区青少年开展的红色宣讲内容，队员们对\"岢岚是个好地方\"这一表述的历史渊源与现实内涵形成了更为完整的认知——它不仅是对岢岚自然风貌的赞誉，更蕴含着对这片土地人民奋斗精神的肯定。展厅内关于岢岚边塞文化、晋绥革命史的展陈，使队员们进一步理解了岢岚红色底蕴与地方文化相互交融的独特品格。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=uUzUUYLN-Pn7L8LnRl4LmCPnzUZUmnS2MR7iLzCaUm-DM470gihFp2hmCIa0UYyZMSyPMYysn7lsMlLZUzvPnm78L7Q7MRvsUNrkUzWRo7VFMzfVU4TRL8MFoR-bozvJqjfTQ4Oeo4xwqsAbgDTJQty0LzGPLSyPLz9aMYbw62z8c&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=11807&e=.jpeg\" draggable=\"false\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/C85177DE75C8A71F140FD477BEBA2C8A/50EC9C3C/82997\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 359px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=uMmlUDnzV7UmrkLnmvYol7sM7lPozVSVoRT7Lz7bnRMfUzG0gihFp2hmCIa0U1yDokyiLSy8nmLbLzWfozCbLz-aozQVL7LZLzA7Ll-iL4QFLRUbnmCiMzAFoRV7M87JqjfTQ4Oeo4xwqsAbgDTJQty0LzGPLSyPLz9aMYbw62z8c&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=11807&e=.jpeg\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=uUz7UaU4rkL4ffMnzA7M4TkozM2Um9SPLmVfMmVkMzr7ozC0gihFp2hmCIa0LkhVokysMkh2LRN8nNr7MNU4n7CPUN7YM77aoRUao7-sM4WFM8nkLl7YUzMFMRVRL7LJqjfTQ4Oeo4xwqsAbgDTJQty0LzGPLSyPLz9aMYbw62z8c&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=11807&e=.jpeg\" draggable=\"false\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/0E874F094FED6D3DF1BA24A08408B772/7DB1A2A3/41C0C\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 359px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=uUz7UaU4rkL4ffMnzA7M4TkozM2Um9SPLmVfMmVkMzr7ozC0gihFp2hmCIa0LkhVokysMkh2LRN8nNr7MNU4n7CPUN7YM77aoRUao7-sM4WFM8nkLl7YUzMFMRVRL7LJqjfTQ4Oeo4xwqsAbgDTJQty0LzGPLSyPLz9aMYbw62z8c&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=11807&e=.jpeg\"></p><p>本次红色研学与前期科创支教、乡村振兴调研形成有机衔接：课堂上向青少年传递的航天理想与红色精神，街巷里向村民收集的乡土发展心声，最终在这片红色沃土上找到了共同的根系。实践队成员表示，此次岢岚之行深化了对\"专业赋能志愿、实践反哺成长\"理念的理解，后续将系统整理活动影像、调研数据及教学素材，建立\"航心映红岚\"实践资源库，持续深化与岢岚团县委及社区站点的长效合作。</p></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://hkyh.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=uM8-UaL7LYMm-bMnmrVnl7bMNl4Mz9SsLl-bo7L8ozLsLm90gihFp2hmCIa0LYyiMSy8M1yPUz9PMm6Rol-Zo7CPM7LaM7MRnR-iUzGaMNrFM4f2nz98MmVFMmr7o7-JqjfTQ4Oeo4xwqsAbgDTJQty0LzGPLSyPLz9aMYbw62z8c&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=11807&e=.jpeg"}